    "summary": "One complete authorized original-source GPT-6.1 Sol ultra pass over all55 physical pages1–55 of the full291page Volume3 archive. This child preserves every native whole assignment, labelled request and complete supplied matching key, chemistry structures, graphs, tables, unfilled diagrams, grading alternatives and common front matter in its exact scoped pages. Actual final scientific crop bytes personally opened, versioned no-snap300DPI uploads and exact publicGET hashes verified. The two actual common cover/rights images are separate documentNote bindings. No independent model checker or ROOT inspection credit; full final MDX inspection must be separately frozen before handoff.",
